  "ruleText": "Env-A 3002.31 \"Source\" for the purposes of Env-A 3000 means \"source\" as defined in the US EPA's proposed Model Open Market Trading Rule (60 FR 39668, August 3, 1995), namely, \"any mobile, area, or stationary source.\"\n\nSource. #6441, EXEMPT, eff 1-21-97",
